                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is the game i'd recommend to someone who wants to get into hack & slash. It's like an easier version of DMC.\n\nGameplay is fun even with bugs, 1 playthrough on normal was enough to master all controls, so 2nd run on hard and Outbreak mode was funner.\n\nStory is kinda boring, the only thing you need to pay attention is to game's pretty PS3 graphics and these two smexy ladies.",
